   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Internet verbs",
   "texto": [
    "**Зайти на сайт** (enter a web) goes with **на** + accusative. **Ввести пароль** (enter the password) carries the add-on in accusative. **Скачать файл** (download a file) and **загрузить файл** (upload a file) also.",
    "**Подключиться к сети** (connect to the network) goes with **к** + dative."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "By mail",
   "texto": [
    "«by email» is used to say **по** + dative: **по электронной почте** (by email). **Электронной** and **почте** are in singular dative.",
    "The imperative is used in instructions: **Введи пароль** (enter the password, you) and **Введите пароль** (enter / enter the password). **-те** forms are used for formal singular treatment or plural treatment; compare it with **Загрузите файл**."
   ]
